  "content": "\n\n```html\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 是許多 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 的 Minecraft 模組所需的函式庫模組。它本身不會新增任何方塊、物品、生物或遊戲玩法；相反地，它提供這些模組正常運作所需的共用系統。🧩</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">對玩家而言，這意味著更簡便的安裝流程，以及在支援的模組之間有更一致的行為表現。如果其他模組將其列為必要依賴，請與該模組一起安裝並保持啟用狀態。✅</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組主要為 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自己的專案而建構，並非旨在為其他模組開發者提供通用型函式庫。其重點在於讓這些模組可靠、易於維護，並能在支援的模組載入器上保持可用。🔧</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必要函式庫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 提供許多 </span><em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">@heyitsfuzs</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組所需的共用基礎。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多載入器支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 協助支援的模組在 Fabric 和 NeoForge 上保持一致運作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">共用模組系統：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 支援相依模組使用的常見功能，例如設定、網路、事件與註冊支援。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">輕量基礎：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在背景運作，不會新增遊戲玩法內容或干擾你的世界。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提升模組包穩定性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 減少模組間的重複系統，讓相依模組表現更一致。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌐 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 專為單人、多人及專用伺服器環境設計。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆為必要安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric 版本需先安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric 版本需先安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bag-of-holding\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tiny-skeletons\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/puzzleslib/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n```",
